<div class="wysiwyg">
  

            <div class="text-long"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;width:100%;"><!-- DO NOT Column --><div style="background-color:#fdf2f2;border-left:4px solid #d9534f;box-sizing:border-box;flex:1;min-width:280px;padding:20px;"><h3 style="color:#d9534f;margin-top:0;">Please DO NOT:</h3><ul style="color:#333;line-height:1.6;margin:0;padding-left:20px;"><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Touch any plants in pots, pick plants, or move plant labels.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Smoke, vape, or consume alcohol in the garden.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Catch or touch any wildlife in the garden.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Cycle, skate, play ball games, or play frisbee.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Walk in the flower beds.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Bring balloons or similar items into the garden.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Set up chairs, tables, or gazebos anywhere in the garden.</li><li style="margin-bottom:0;">Bring dogs or other pets into the garden (except service animals).</li></ul></div><!-- DO Column --><div style="background-color:#f2f9f4;border-left:4px solid #5cb85c;box-sizing:border-box;flex:1;min-width:280px;padding:20px;"><h3 style="color:#5cb85c;margin-top:0;">Please DO:</h3><ul style="color:#333;line-height:1.6;margin:0;padding-left:20px;"><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Take time to look, listen, and enjoy the natural surroundings.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Enjoy a picnic on the designated Picnic Lawn.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Take photographs of our beautiful garden. Please note that commercial or group photography requires a permit.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Read and follow the garden signage.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Dispose of litter in the provided bins.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Supervise children at all times.</li><li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Ask questions—our staff are always happy to assist.</li><li style="margin-bottom:0;">Treat our staff with respect.</li></ul></div></div></div>
      
</div>

      </div>
      </div>

    
        </div>
</section>


  


        





