<div class="wysiwyg">
  

            <div class="text-long"><h2 style="color:#61233c;"><a style="margin-top:-250px;padding-top:250px;" name="resturant">Botanical Café</a></h2></div>
      
</div>



<div class="wysiwyg">
  

            <div class="text-long"><p><span>The Botanical Café, located in the heart of the Stellenbosch University Botanical Garden in South Africa, is a charming spot with a rich history. The restaurant is surrounded by beautiful, lush greenery, making it a peaceful and idyllic setting for visitors.</span></p></div>
      
</div>





<div class="button-group">
          
        



  <a class="button--primary--outline"
              href="https://www.botanicalcafe.co.za/"
                  aria-label="Visit the Cafe website"
                  target="_self"
    >
        <span  class="button__title">Visit the Cafe website</span>
  </a>


  </div>

      </div>
    
          <div  class="layout__region layout__region--bottom">
        
      </div>
      </div>

    
        </div>
</section>


  


        





<section id=section-156748  class="section section--margin--no-margin-top">
  <div class="section__inner">
          <div class="layout layout--twocol">
          <div  class="layout__region layout__region--top">
        
      </div>
    
          <div  class="layout__region layout__region--first">
        


<div class="wysiwyg">
  

            <div class="text-long"><h2 style="color:#61233c;"><a style="margin-top:-220px;padding-top:220px;" name="shop">Botanical Gift Shop</a></h2></div>
      
</div>



<div class="wysiwyg">
  

            <div class="text-long"><h4>A Botanical Experience Rooted in Conservation and Discovery</h4><p>Now located in a spacious new building, the botanical shop offers a thoughtfully curated selection of botanically inspired products, rare plants, and homeware.</p><p>Every item reflects our deep connection to the natural world, with a strong focus on sustainability, education, and conservation</p></div>
      
</div>





<div class="button-group">
          
        



  <a class="button--primary--outline"
              href="https://subggiftshop.co.za/"
                  aria-label="Visit the Gift Shop"
                  target="_self"
    >
        <span  class="button__title">Visit the Gift Shop</span>
  </a>


  </div>

