<div class="wysiwyg">
  

            <div class="text-long"><h3 style="color:#61233c;font-size:36px;line-height:40px;"><a style="margin-top:-200px;padding-top:200px;" name="photography">Photography &amp; Facilities</a></h3></div>
      
</div>



<div class="wysiwyg">
  

            <div class="text-long"><p>The beautiful natural surroundings of the Botanical Garden is an&nbsp;ideal setting for photographic shoots and garden functions.</p><ul><li>The unique Botanical Café*&nbsp;indoor studio, overlooking the lush Fern House&nbsp;is ideal for small conferences, exhibitions or workshops. </li><li>All photography and formal photo shoots must be arranged with the office.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Contact <strong>Razelle Galant</strong>&nbsp;at 021 808 3054 | <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2c5e4d56494040496c5f5942024d4f02564d"><strong><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7c0e1d06191010193c0f0912521d1f52061d">[email&#160;protected]</span></strong></a> to make arrangements.</p></div>
      
</div>

    </div>
  </div>

    
        </div>
</section>



